    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.84,
      "text": "He has an interesting job, and I'll let him introduce himself, and then we can learn more about what he does."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.36,
      "end": 13.64,
      "text": "My name's Kyle, and I just moved here to Bend from Boulder, Colorado about eight months ago."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.24,
      "end": 18.82,
      "text": "And just found this job on Craigslist, which it was really easy."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.02,
      "end": 27.04,
      "text": "Came for an interview, met the guy, saw the two shops, and I was like, all right, let's give this a try and see how it goes."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.18,
      "end": 27.44,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.82,
      "end": 29.48,
      "text": "And it's worked out really well."
